      "value": "<p><strong>Concept-Voice (1/Scene Break).</strong> Name a single concept as an action (a fear, a memory, a desire). One creature within 6 squares that can hear you takes 4d6 psychic damage and is Charmed or Frightened by the named concept until the end of your next turn (Soul check DC 8 + Tier + Presence for half damage and to negate the condition).</p>",
